2/20/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2018 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2019-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael C. McMurray","x":"Sales in Insulation for the fourth quarter were $732 million, up 23% from the same period a year ago, primarily on strong price realization and the contribution of the Paroc acquisition, partially offset by lower sales volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/20/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2018 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2019-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael C. McMurray","x":"As a result, we've announced a price increase that will be effective in April.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/20/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2018 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2019-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael C. McMurray","x":"The year-over-year incremental depreciation and amortization from our Insulation acquisition was partially offset by lower accelerated depreciation associated with the prior year's Composite restructuring actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/20/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2018 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2019-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael C. McMurray","x":"For the full year, our adjusting items totaled $40 million, $19 million were primarily related to restructuring charges resulting from actions announced last year to strengthen the Composites' low delivered cost position and $21 million were acquisition related costs in our Insulation business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/20/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2019-04-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael McMurray","x":"And then in regards to tariffs in Europe, yeah, there is the possibility of some anti-dumping on tariffs, but that's probably all I'm going to say at this point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2019-04-24","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Kathryn Thompson","x":"And also wanted to get your thoughts and any color on the potential for additional tariffs coming out of Europe on composites out of the Middle East?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2019-04-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":"Continued strong price realization helped to offset inflation and lower volumes, which largely tracked our regional markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2019-04-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":"For 2019, we now expect positive pricing to be more than offset by lower volumes and production curtailments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2019-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael McMurray","x":"For the first quarter, our adjusting items amounted to a $2 million net gain, which was primarily related to the contract restructuring associated with the previously announced composites low-delivered cost actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2019-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael McMurray","x":"…glass strategic supply lines with CPIC in China and our previously announced high cost smelter restructuring actions will drive manufacturing productivity and improve our cost position in 2019 and beyond. While our first quarter volumes were positive, the global industrial production growth…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2019-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael C. McMurray","x":"As expected, lower demand in the quarter and the impact of production curtailment actions in this business more than offset positive pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2019-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael C. McMurray","x":"We implemented a successful April price increase and we announced a further increase effective in July to offset the expected asphalt inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael C. McMurray","x":"…low-cost India facility expansion, our high strength glass strategic supply lines with CPIC in China, and our previously announced high cost smelter restructuring actions will drive manufacturing productivity and improve our cost position in the second half, which will further build in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2019-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":"Overall, operating expenses in the first half were below last year and we have reduced our full-year outlook for corporate expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2019-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Kathryn Thompson","x":"Could you help us understand what region and which end markets were the primary drivers for this slightly lower guidance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2019-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael McMurray","x":"While we did not make progress with our July price increase, shingle pricing was broadly stable during the quarter and in line with the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/owens-corning-inc-oc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2019-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael McMurray","x":"In terms of the other comments around the headwinds, last year, when we look at the pricing evolution, last year we implemented three price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/owens-corning-inc-oc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael McMurray","x":"These actions will result in restructuring and other related charges of approximately $30 million, of which 15 million is non-cash.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/owens-corning-inc-oc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael McMurray","x":"…we expect that our recently completed low cost India facility expansion, our high strength glass strategic supply lines with CPIC in China and our previously announced high-cost smelter restructuring actions will drive manufacturing productivity and continue to improve our cost position.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/owens-corning-inc-oc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2019-10-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":"Year-to-date, marketing and administrative costs, along with science and technology costs, remained relatively flat versus last year and we have further reduced our full year outlook for corporate expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/owens-corning-inc-oc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2019-10-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":"We also continued to actively evaluate our capital investments, and have further reduced our full year outlook by $15 million, bringing our total capital expenditures in line with depreciation and amortization for 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/owens-corning-inc-oc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2020-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":"But again, we've showed positive pricing gains in 2019 within the technical and other insulation business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2020-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Prith Gandhi","x":"The growth in the fourth quarter of 2019 was due to accelerated depreciation from the insulation and restructuring actions announced in October.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2019 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2020-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Prith Gandhi","x":"We also recorded $28 million of restructuring costs primarily associated with insulation network optimization actions announced in October.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2020-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Prithvi Gandhi","x":"In our North American residential fiberglass insulation business, favorable price realization from a January increase helped to partially offset negative price carryover from last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Prithvi Gandhi","x":"Depreciation and amortization expense for the quarter was $116 million, up slightly as compared to Q1 2019 due to accelerated depreciation from the insulation restructuring actions announced last October.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Prithvi Gandhi","x":"During the first quarter, we recorded $5 million of restructuring costs, primarily associated with the insulation network optimization actions we announced last October.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2020-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Prithvi S. Gandhi","x":"In addition, we realized a $10 million onetime gain that benefited our margins by 150 basis points related to an exclusion on certain tariffs paid over the last two years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2020-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Prithvi S. Gandhi","x":"The U.S. government recently provided a tariff exclusion covering certain components products that we imported from China dating back to late 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2020-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Prithvi S. Gandhi","x":"Within North American residential fiberglass insulation, sales volumes were largely consistent with Q2 2019 and some favorable price realization on the January price increase helped to partially offset negative price carryover from last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2020-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian D. Chambers","x":"While the current pricing environment has remained relatively stable, in the third quarter, we expect to continue to face an increasing year-over-year headwind from the lack of a spring price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Prithvi S. Gandhi","x":"During the second quarter, we took actions to reduce personnel costs in our Composites segment and recorded $5 million of restructuring costs associated with these actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian D. Chambers","x":"We took that restructuring charge where we expected to see about $20 million of cost benefit in the Insulation business this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/owens-corning-inc-oc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2020-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"The current pricing environment has improved sequentially with the realization of our August increase, partially offsetting the year-over-year headwind from the lack of a spring price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/owens-corning-inc-oc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2020-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":"While we are seeing positive traction from the mid-September residential insulation price increase, we don't expect to come positively yet in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/owens-corning-inc-oc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2021-02-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"We continue to be encouraged by US residential new construction demand and the realization of our September price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/17/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2021-02-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":"Our North American residential volumes are expected to largely track with the market during the quarter, and we continue to see favorable pricing based on positive traction from our January price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/17/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2021-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"The growth in the fourth quarter of 2020 was mainly impacted by higher accelerated depreciation from this quarter's restructuring actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/17/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"OC 2020 Q4","e":"oc","d":"2021-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"For 2020, depreciation and amortization expense was $493 million, up from $457 million in the prior year, primarily due to higher accelerated depreciation from our restructuring actions and incremental amortization from new finance leases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/17/owens-corning-inc-oc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"OC 2021 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":"Our performance during the quarter was driven by good volumes, broad price realization and strong manufacturing efficiencies across all our businesses, resulting in an adjusted EBIT margin for the company of 15%, with all three of our businesses posting double-digit EBIT margins for the third…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"OC 2021 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"Positive price realization and manufacturing productivity more than offset the inflation headwind in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"OC 2021 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"In addition, we recorded $1 million of restructuring costs associated with the Insulation network optimization actions that we initiated in the fourth quarter of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/owens-corning-inc-oc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"OC 2021 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":"Our performance during the quarter was driven by strong volumes, broad price realization and high manufacturing efficiencies across all of our businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/owens-corning-oc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2021 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"Overall, positive price realization more than offset the inflation headwind in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/owens-corning-oc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2021 Q2","e":"oc","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"In addition, we recorded $1 million of restructuring costs associated with previously announced actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/owens-corning-oc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2021 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"Overall positive price realization more than offset the inflation headwind in all 3 businesses in the quarter and year-to-date.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/owens-corning-oc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2021 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"In North American Residential Fiberglass Insulation, we saw year-over-year growth driven by positive pricing and stronger volumes benefiting from incremental capacity additions over the past year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/owens-corning-oc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2021 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Parks","x":"Slide 6 reconciles our 3rd quarter adjusted EBIT of $400 million to our reported EBIT of $394 million during the quarter we recorded $20 million of restructuring costs associated with previously announced actions, which includes $19 million for the Santa Clara facility sale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/owens-corning-oc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2025 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Todd W. Fister","x":"Price cost was negative in the quarter as pricing was down slightly and inflation, primarily tariffs, continues to impact the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/owens-corning-oc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2025 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Todd W. Fister","x":"Overall for the company, there was about $12 million in net impact from tariffs in Q3.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/owens-corning-oc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2025 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Todd W. Fister","x":"In the quarter, revenue growth was driven by positive price realization on our April increase, with volumes relatively flat.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/owens-corning-oc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2025 Q3","e":"oc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian D. Chambers","x":"Additionally, we have identified an additional €75 million of structural cost savings through operational improvements and plant consolidations, giving us a lower cost position to leverage as volumes increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/owens-corning-oc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2026 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Todd Fister","x":"Anything related to AI, data centers, the reindustrialization of North America has been strong for us on the nonres side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/owens-corning-oc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2026 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Todd Fister","x":"Overall for the company, there was about $13 million in net impact from tariffs in Q1 versus prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/owens-corning-oc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2026 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Todd Fister","x":"As a result of the recent Supreme Court ruling on tariffs, the company may be eligible for approximately $50 million in refunds across the enterprise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/owens-corning-oc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OC 2026 Q1","e":"oc","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Chambers","x":